<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστύφω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw up, contract,</i> of the effect of astringents,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δριμέα . . ὥστε ἀποστύφειν</span> arist.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				863a18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.8.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείλεα ἀ.</span>
			<i>screw</i> them <i>up,AP</i><i><span class="en">
				7.536
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, pf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρα δ᾽ ἀπέστυπται</span>”
				<i>are stopped,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					433
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of preparing
			tissues for dyes, <i>mordant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PHolm.
				9.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστύφων: τῇ φωνῆ σκληρός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
